{"version":1,"content":"<p>周四（10月29日）本港大致多雲。</p><p>初時有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>早上最低氣溫約25°C。</p><p>日間漸轉天晴及乾燥，最高氣溫約29°C。</p><p>吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>隨後一兩日日間大致天晴及乾燥。</p><p>下周日（11月1日）雲量增多。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.748794+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:06:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:06.334454+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:14.238442+00:00","content_hash":"285857d4dcf383779b8b806cd0a3b72a37c9e657eb1e5cf7bc31dd0d942e99b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}